                <pb facs="d259-7" n="7" sameAs="frus:frus1958-60v03mSupp/d259-7"/>


                <head>Memorandum for General Power, USAF</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian">undated</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d259-8" n="8" type="facsimile" xml:id="d259-8"/>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Director of Strategic Target Planning</item>
                </list>
                <p>1. You are hereby designated Director of Strategic Target Planning for the Joint
                    Chiefs of Staff.</p>
                <p>2. Your task, responsibility and authority are as contained in the National
                    Strategic Targeting and Attack Policy dated ____________.</p>
                <pb facs="1188" n="1083" type="typeset" xml:id="pg1083"/>
                <p>3. Selected portions of Study 2009 are being forwarded to you under separate
                    cover. Access to this study will be on a strict need-to-know basis in connection
                    with your duties as Director of Strategic Target Planning.</p>
            </div>
